E.41. e₂-an-ka me-bi ha-ba-gub-be₂
#lem: Eanak[1]TN; me[Being]; gub[stand]
#tr.en: @q{“May you establish the divine powers of @wTN{E-ana}! 
#etcsl: line-id=E.41

E.42. {d}ur-{d}nin-urta bad₃ gal-zu ŋe₂₆-e-me-en ud ul du-ri₂-še₃
#lem: Urninurta[1]RN; bad[wall]; gal[big]; ŋaʾe[I]; ud[sun]; ul[distant time]; duri[forever]
#tr.en: @wRN{Ur-@wDN{Ninurta}}, I am your great wall permanently and forever!”} 
#etcsl: line-id=E.42

