@div kirugu G

G.57. en eš-bar an ki šu-na ŋal₂ kur gal {d}en-lil₂-le
#lem: en[lord]; ešbar[decision]; an[sky]; ki[place]; šu[hand]; ŋal[⟦be⟧ to be (there]; kur[mountain(s)]; gal[big]; Enlil[1]DN
#tr.en: The lord who has the decisions of heaven and earth in his hands, the Great Mountain @wDN{Enlil}, 
#etcsl: line-id=G.57

G.58. lugal-ra mu-ni an-zag-še₃ pa e₃ im-ma-an-ak
#lem: lugal[king]; mu[name]; anzag[horizon]; pa[branch]; e[leave]; ak[do]
#tr.en: has made the king's fame extend as far as the boundaries of heaven: @q[Enlil,Ur-Ninurta]{“@wRN{Ur-@wDN{Ninurta}}! 
#etcsl: line-id=G.58

G.59. {d}ur-{d}nin-urta nam-nir nam-šul-la am-gin₇ gu₂ he₂-ni-peš
#lem: Urninurta[1]RN; namnir[supremacy]; namšul[manhood]; am[wild bull]; gu[neck]; peš[thick]
#tr.en: In authority and youthfulness may your neck be as fat as a wild bull's. Like the warrior @wDN{Erra}, 
#etcsl: line-id=G.59

G.60. {d}er₉-ra ur-saŋ-gin₇ me X [...]-an-tuku-tuku
#lem: Erra[1]DN; ursaŋ[warrior]; me[Being]; X; tuku[acquire]
#tr.en: ……, may my avenging son, 
#etcsl: line-id=G.60

G.61. {d}nin-urta en ud huš erim₂-ma dumu šu ŋar gi₄-ŋu₁₀
#lem: Ninurtak[1]DN; en[lord]; ud[storm]; huš[reddish]; erim[enemy]; dumu[child]; šu[hand]; ŋar[put]; gi[turn]
#tr.en: Lord @wDN{Ninurta}, a furious storm against the enemy, 
#etcsl: line-id=G.61

G.62. ki me₃-ka ka-tab-zu he₂-a ŋiškim he₂-mu-e-til₃-le
#lem: ki[place]; me[battle]; katab[helper?]; me[be]; ŋeškim[sign]; til[live (of a single person)]
#tr.en: be your helper on the battlefield, and may you put your trust in him. 
#etcsl: line-id=G.62

G.63. kur gu₂-erim₂ gu₂-bi-da [...]-zu zar-re-eš ha-ma-ab-sal-e
#lem: kur[mountain(s)]; guʾerim[hostile]; gu[neck]; X; zar[sheaf (of barley)]; sal[thin]
#tr.en: …… the enemy land, and may he spread out in heaps for me ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=G.63

G.64. šu-luh kug e₂-kur-ra ba-an-ši-ib#-[...]-en ud šu₂-uš-e gub-ba
#lem: šuluh[ritual cleansing]; kug[purify]; Ekur[1]TN; X; ud[sun]; šuš[cover]; gub[stand]
#tr.en: The holy purification rites of @wTN{E-kur} ……, serving daily. 
#etcsl: line-id=G.64

G.65. nidba-zu banšur mah unu₂ gal-ŋa₂ su₃-ra₂-še₃ he₂-em-mi-in-ŋal₂
#lem: nindaba[(food) offering]; banšur[table]; mah[great]; unu[dwelling]; gal[big]; sud[distant]; ŋal[⟦be⟧ to be (there]
#tr.en: May your offerings on the august table in my great dining hall be everlasting. May you lift your head and raise your neck to the heavens. 
#etcsl: line-id=G.65

G.66. saŋ he₂-e-il₂ gu₂# an#-še₃ he₂-e-zig₃ til₃ nu-kur₂-ru za-a-am₃
#lem: saŋ[head]; il[raise]; gu[neck]; an[sky]; zig[rise]; til[live (of a single person)]; kur[different]; zaʾe[you]
#tr.en: Life is yours, irrevocably.”} 
#etcsl: line-id=G.66

