@div kirugu H

H.68. nam tar-ra an gal {[d]}nu-nam-nir en niŋ₂-zi-ŋal₂-la-še₃
#lem: nam[fate]; tar[cut]; An[1]DN; gal[big]; Nunamnir[1]DN; en[lord]; niŋziŋal[living creature]
#tr.en: The @wDN{Anuna}, the great gods, said @q[Anuna,]{“Let it be so!”} to the destiny determined by great @wDN{An} and by @wDN{Nunamnir}, the lord of all living beings. 
#etcsl: line-id=H.68

H.69. {d}a-nun-na diŋir gal-gal-e-ne he₂-am₃ ba-ni-in-ne-eš
#lem: Anunak[1]DN; diŋir[deity]; gal[big]; heʾam[so be it!]; e[speak]
#tr.en: In order to strengthen the black-headed in their dwelling-places, to keep the foreign lands on the track, 
#etcsl: line-id=H.69

